OL,3,GNEWSAMP and MSP detained by Israel and
OL,4,Abarred from entering West Bank
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo Scottish politicians have said they
OL,7,Fwere detained by Israeli authorities
OL,8,Ffor eight hours while trying to enter
OL,9,Fthe West Bank.
OL,11,FSNP MP Lara Bird and Scottish Greens
OL,12,FMSP Kate Nevens said they were
OL,13,Fprevented from entering the territory
OL,14,Fbefore being questioned and eventually
OL,15,Fturned away.
OL,17,FBird said in a social media post that
OL,18,Fthey had intended to "stand alongside
OL,19,FPalestinians being attacked for
OL,20,Fharvesting olives on their own land".
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
